<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 3.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 3.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Thursday, April 3 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   03.04.97	  02.03.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.5868	 6.5660</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3937	 2.3986</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.6584	 4.6646</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2706	 3.2382</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5268	 0.5298</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.8032	 0.8055</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2993	 0.2998</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.9114	 6.9067</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6970	 0.6972</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.3030	 1.3041</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
